--   numeral spellings: two, three, four, five, NatArith.plus (Cor. 11 at c = 2:
--     isTrunc ((2+1)+(2+1)) = isTrunc 6, in LoopEq.LE);
--   by-definition steps of the text: Omega (in E.r-def, contr3, deloop-R/Tor);
--     om (delta g) = (loop (dl g), ..) in LoopEq.om-delta (opens loop, D,
